      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "According to my recent canny, it's been marked as \"tracked bug\". Anyway, I hope they would fix it as soon as possible.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/av3-animations-bugging-when-sitting-on-a-station-that-doesnt-have-a-animator",
